  "summary": "Shopify deprecates the PRIVATE and PUBLIC_READ metaobject admin access values",
  "details": "The PRIVATE and PUBLIC_READ values of the MetaobjectAdminAccess enum are deprecated and are never returned by the API; they go away with API version 2027-01.\n\nStop sending PRIVATE or PUBLIC_READ as a metaobject definition's admin access, and drop code that expects them back.",
